<script data-page="app" type="application/json">{"component":"flashcards\/study","props":{"errors":{},"name":"Topwords","auth":{"user":{"id":5,"name":"\u00c1rp\u00e1d Szaniszl\u00f3","email":"developedbybarley@gmail.com","email_verified_at":null,"two_factor_confirmed_at":null,"streak":12,"quiz_completions":1,"text_analyses":14,"last_activity_date":"2026-05-15T00:00:00.000000Z","onboarding_completed_at":"2026-04-18T19:40:25.000000Z","created_at":"2026-04-18T19:40:03.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-05-15T20:26:09.000000Z","stripe_id":"cus_UR8u0ziMkWwJIo","pm_type":null,"pm_last_four":null,"trial_ends_at":null,"ai_access":false,"subscriptions":[]},"isAdmin":true,"subscription":{"hasActiveAccess":true,"isSubscribed":false,"isPremium":false,"hasAiAccess":false,"isOnTrial":false}},"sidebarOpen":true,"flash":{"streakTriggered":null,"success":null,"achievements":[],"calibrationPrompt":null,"showTour":false,"importedCardId":null},"deck":{"id":38,"name":"May"},"cards":[{"id":51278,"front":"<p>It took me a while to _______ to the new city&#039;s fast pace. <em>(hozz\u00e1szokik \/ megszokik)<\/em><\/p><p>The company aims to _______ its employees to the new software system by providing extensive training. <em>(hozz\u00e1szoktat \/ megismertet \/ felk\u00e9sz\u00edt)<\/em><\/p><p>Researchers are studying how to _______ laboratory animals to the experimental conditions without causing undue stress. <em>(hozz\u00e1szoktat \/ alkalmazkod\u00e1sra b\u00edr)<\/em><\/p><p>She had to _______ herself to the harsh realities of life on the frontier. <em>(hozz\u00e1szoktat \/ felv\u00e9rtez \/ felk\u00e9sz\u00edt)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">hozz\u00e1szokik \/ megszokik \/ hozz\u00e1szoktat \/ alkalmazkodik \/ szoktat<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): nem szokik hozz\u00e1 \/ idegenkedik \/ ellen\u00e1ll<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ to something = hozz\u00e1szokik valamihez (pl. It takes time to _______ to the cold weather.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ someone to something = hozz\u00e1szoktat valakit valamihez (pl. We need to _______ the new employees _______ the company culture.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ oneself to something = hozz\u00e1szoktatja mag\u00e1t valamihez (pl. He had to _______ himself _______ the long hours.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ to change = hozz\u00e1szokik a v\u00e1ltoz\u00e1shoz (pl. It&#039;s important to _______ to change in this industry.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>accustom<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>accustom<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: accustom to \/ accustom oneself to \/ accustom to change \/ accustom to new environment<\/span><\/p><p>similar: familiarize \/ habituate \/ adapt \/ orient<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: unfamiliarize \/ disorient \/ alienate<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"accustom","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":1,"lapses":1,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"15 perc","good":"1 nap","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-19T12:10:47+00:00"},{"id":51270,"front":"<p>The hotel had a lot of _______ rooms, so we got a good deal. <em>(\u00fcres \/ szabad)<\/em><\/p><p>Please ensure all positions are filled; we cannot leave any _______. <em>(bet\u00f6ltetlen \/ \u00fcresed\u00e9s)<\/em><\/p><p>The study found that a significant percentage of laboratory equipment remained _______ for extended periods. <em>(haszn\u00e1laton k\u00edv\u00fcli \/ nem haszn\u00e1lt)<\/em><\/p><p>The ancient manor stood silent, its grand halls _______ and echoing with the ghosts of its past. <em>(elhagyatott \/ l\u00e1togat\u00f3kt\u00f3l mentes)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">\u00fcres \/ szabad \/ bet\u00f6ltetlen \/ elhagyatott \/ nem foglalt<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): foglalt \/ betelt \/ haszn\u00e1lt<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ room = \u00fcres szoba (pl. The hotel has many vacant rooms.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ position = bet\u00f6ltetlen \u00e1ll\u00e1s (pl. There are several vacant positions in the company.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ seat = szabad \u00fcl\u0151hely (pl. Is this seat vacant?)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ property = \u00fcres ingatlan (pl. The council is trying to redevelop vacant property.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>vacant<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>vacant<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>vacance<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: vacant room \/ vacant position \/ vacant seat \/ vacant lot<\/span><\/p><p>similar: empty \/ unoccupied \/ available \/ free<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: occupied \/ full \/ taken<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#f264ed","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"2 nap","good":"2 nap","easy":"3 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-20T12:10:08+00:00"},{"id":51268,"front":"<p>He&#039;s so _______, he never changes his mind even when he&#039;s wrong. <em>(makacs \/ merev)<\/em><\/p><p>Despite the overwhelming evidence, the committee remained _______ in its decision. <em>(hajthatatlan \/ kitart\u00f3)<\/em><\/p><p>The research highlights the _______ nature of certain societal attitudes, resisting reform. <em>(kem\u00e9ny \/ rugalmatlan)<\/em><\/p><p>Her _______ refusal to compromise threatened to derail the entire negotiation. <em>(szil\u00e1rd \/ engedetlen)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">makacs \/ kem\u00e9ny \/ merev \/ hajthatatlan \/ szil\u00e1rd<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): enged\u00e9keny \/ rugalmas \/ nyitott<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ child = makacs gyerek (pl. My _______ child refuses to eat vegetables.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ to = valamihez ragaszkod\u00f3 (pl. He&#039;s _______ to his old ways.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ refusal = makacs visszautas\u00edt\u00e1s (pl. Her _______ refusal to cooperate was frustrating.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ attitude = makacs hozz\u00e1\u00e1ll\u00e1s (pl. The _______ attitude of the management made progress difficult.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>stubborn<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>stubborn<\/strong><\/p><p>adverb: <strong>stubbornly<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>stubbornness<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: stubborn mule \/ stubborn fact \/ stubborn stain \/ stubborn resistance<\/span><\/p><p>similar: obstinate \/ unyielding \/ inflexible \/ headstrong<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: flexible \/ compliant \/ amenable<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"2 nap","good":"2 nap","easy":"3 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-16T12:12:44+00:00"},{"id":51286,"front":"<p>It&#039;s easy to _______ the warning signs when you&#039;re in a hurry, but it can have serious consequences. <em>(figyelmen k\u00edv\u00fcl hagy \/ nem vesz tudom\u00e1sul)<\/em><\/p><p>The committee decided to _______ the minor procedural error and proceed with the vote. <em>(mell\u0151z \/ nem vesz figyelembe)<\/em><\/p><p>Such a blatant _______ for safety regulations is unacceptable and will result in severe penalties. <em>(semmibe v\u00e9tel \/ figyelmen k\u00edv\u00fcl hagy\u00e1s)<\/em><\/p><p>Despite repeated pleas, the government continued its _______ for public opinion on the controversial policy. <em>(mell\u0151z\u00e9s \/ nemt\u00f6r\u0151d\u00f6ms\u00e9g)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">figyelmen k\u00edv\u00fcl hagy \/ semmibe vesz \/ mell\u0151z<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): figyelembe vesz \/ t\u00f6r\u0151dik vele \/ fontosnak tart<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ a warning = figyelmeztet\u00e9st figyelmen k\u00edv\u00fcl hagy (pl. He chose to _______ a warning about the icy roads.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ advice = tan\u00e1csot semmibe vesz (pl. She decided to _______ her doctor&#039;s advice.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 a complete _______ for = teljes figyelmen k\u00edv\u00fcl hagy\u00e1s valami ir\u00e1nt (pl. His actions showed a complete _______ for the rules.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ the law = semmibe veszi a t\u00f6rv\u00e9nyt (pl. Some companies _______ the law to cut costs.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>disregard<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>disregard<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>disregard<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: disregard for safety \/ disregard for rules \/ disregard for consequences \/ disregard for feelings<\/span><\/p><p>similar: ignore \/ overlook \/ neglect \/ discount<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: heed \/ observe \/ regard<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":2,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"3 nap","good":"4 nap","easy":"5 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-18T00:09:40+00:00"},{"id":51276,"front":"<p>The police managed to _______ the drug shipment before it reached the city. <em>(megakad\u00e1lyoz \/ lefoglal)<\/em><\/p><p>In tennis, a player can _______ their opponent&#039;s serve if they are fast enough. <em>(vissza\u00fct \/ elkap)<\/em><\/p><p>The intelligence agency was able to _______ the communication between the two hostile nations. <em>(lehallgat \/ elfog)<\/em><\/p><p>The knight bravely rode to _______ the princess from the dragon&#039;s lair. <em>(megment \/ kiszabad\u00edt)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">elfog \/ megakad\u00e1lyoz \/ lefoglal \/ megment \/ visszafog<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): elenged \/ \u00e1tenged \/ seg\u00edt<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ a message = \u00fczenetet elfog\/lehallgat (pl. They managed to intercept a coded message.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ a pass = passzt elfog\/elkap (pl. The defender intercepted the pass and scored.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ a shipment = sz\u00e1ll\u00edtm\u00e1nyt elfog\/lefoglal (pl. Customs officials will intercept illegal goods.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ communication = kommunik\u00e1ci\u00f3t lehallgat\/elfog (pl. The spy agency can intercept enemy communications.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>intercept<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>interception<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>intercept<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: intercept a pass \/ intercept a message \/ intercept a shipment \/ intercept communication<\/span><\/p><p>similar: catch \/ stop \/ seize \/ block<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: release \/ allow \/ forward<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"intercept\ninterception","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":2,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"3 nap","good":"4 nap","easy":"5 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-19T12:15:39+00:00"},{"id":51280,"front":"<p>She asked a friend to _______ her to the party. <em>(k\u00eds\u00e9r \/ elmegy vele)<\/em><\/p><p>The diplomat was provided with an armed _______ for his protection. <em>(test\u0151r \/ biztos\u00edt\u00e1s)<\/em><\/p><p>The study examined the role of a mentor as an _______ for junior researchers. <em>(ir\u00e1ny\u00edt\u00f3 \/ seg\u00edt\u0151)<\/em><\/p><p>As the ship sailed into the harbor, a smaller tugboat came to _______ it safely to the dock. <em>(vezetni \/ seg\u00edteni a man\u0151verez\u00e9sben)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">k\u00eds\u00e9r \/ v\u00e9d \/ k\u00eds\u00e9ret \/ seg\u00edt \/ vezet<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): elhagy \/ mag\u00e1ra hagy \/ nem seg\u00edt<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ someone to a place = valakit elvinni\/elvezetni egy helyre (pl. He will escort you to your seat.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 provide an _______ = biztos\u00edtani valakit\/valamit (pl. The VIP was provided with an escort.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ service = k\u00eds\u00e9r\u0151 szolg\u00e1ltat\u00e1s (pl. The hotel offers a complimentary escort service.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ a ship = haj\u00f3t k\u00eds\u00e9rni\/vezetni (pl. The pilot will escort the ship into port.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>escort<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>escort<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>escort<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: bodyguard escort \/ security escort \/ military escort \/ police escort<\/span><\/p><p>similar: accompany \/ guide \/ shepherd \/ convoy<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: abandon \/ leave \/ forsake<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"escort","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":2,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"3 nap","good":"4 nap","easy":"5 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-14T18:55:25+00:00"},{"id":51282,"front":"<p>He decided to _______ down and rest for a while. <em>(pihen \/ nyugszik)<\/em><\/p><p>The company was accused of deliberately _______ the truth about its financial situation. <em>(elhallgat \/ elferd\u00edt)<\/em><\/p><p>The report aims to _______ the current state of research in the field. <em>(ismertet \/ bemutat)<\/em><\/p><p>The old storyteller would often _______ tales of brave knights and mythical beasts. <em>(mes\u00e9l \/ mond)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">fekszik \/ hazudik \/ ter\u00fcl \/ mond \/ besz\u00e9l<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): igazat mond \/ felfed \/ leplez<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ down = lefekszik, lepihen (pl. I&#039;m going to _______ down for a nap.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ the truth = igazat mond (pl. You must always _______ the truth.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ a story = mes\u00e9t mond (pl. She likes to _______ her children a story before bed.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ on its side = az oldal\u00e1n fekszik (pl. The fallen tree _______ on its side.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>lie<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>lie<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: lie down \/ tell a lie \/ lie in bed \/ lie still<\/span><\/p><p>similar: recline \/ rest \/ be situated \/ tell an untruth<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: stand \/ sit \/ tell the truth<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"lie","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":3,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"4 nap","good":"6 nap","easy":"8 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-14T18:53:37+00:00"},{"id":51288,"front":"<p>The street _______ was selling fresh flowers and handmade crafts at the market. <em>(\u00e1rus \/ keresked\u0151)<\/em><\/p><p>Before purchasing the software, we need to evaluate the different _______ options available. <em>(sz\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00f3 \/ forgalmaz\u00f3)<\/em><\/p><p>The company decided to switch to a new IT _______ after experiencing poor service from their previous one. <em>(szolg\u00e1ltat\u00f3 \/ besz\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00f3)<\/em><\/p><p>At the trade show, each _______ showcased their latest products and innovations. <em>(ki\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00f3 \/ elad\u00f3)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">elad\u00f3 \/ \u00e1rus \/ sz\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00f3<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): vev\u0151 \/ v\u00e1s\u00e1rl\u00f3 \/ fogyaszt\u00f3<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 third-party _______ = harmadik f\u00e9l sz\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00f3 (pl. We rely on a third-party _______ for our logistics.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 software _______ = szoftver sz\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00f3 (pl. Choosing the right software _______ is crucial for our operations.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 street _______ = utcai \u00e1rus (pl. The street _______ offered delicious hot dogs.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 preferred _______ = prefer\u00e1lt sz\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00f3 (pl. They are our preferred _______ for office supplies.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>vendor<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>vendor<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: vendor agreement \/ vendor management \/ vendor relationship \/ vendor selection<\/span><\/p><p>similar: seller \/ supplier \/ merchant \/ dealer<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: buyer \/ customer \/ purchaser<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"2 nap","good":"2 nap","easy":"3 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-20T12:09:34+00:00"},{"id":51272,"front":"<p>Due to unforeseen _______, the wedding had to be postponed. <em>(k\u00f6r\u00fclm\u00e9nyek \/ helyzet)<\/em><\/p><p>The judge considered all the _______ before making a decision. <em>(t\u00e9nyez\u0151k \/ viszonyok)<\/em><\/p><p>The research paper analyzed the socio-economic _______ that contributed to the decline. <em>(h\u00e1tt\u00e9r \/ k\u00f6rnyezet)<\/em><\/p><p>She found herself in a difficult _______, with no easy way out. <em>(helyzet \/ \u00e1llapot)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">k\u00f6r\u00fclm\u00e9ny \/ helyzet \/ t\u00e9nyez\u0151 \/ viszony \/ \u00e1llapot<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): szabads\u00e1g \/ f\u00fcggetlens\u00e9g \/ egyszer\u0171s\u00e9g<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 under the _______ of = valaminek a _______ alatt (pl. under the _______ of his parents)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 given the _______ = a _______eket figyelembe v\u00e9ve (pl. given the _______, we should proceed cautiously)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 extenuating _______ = enyh\u00edt\u0151 _______ek (pl. there were extenuating _______ for his absence)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 adverse _______ = kedvez\u0151tlen _______ek (pl. the project faced adverse _______)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 difficult _______ = neh\u00e9z _______ek (pl. she overcame many difficult _______)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>circumstance<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>circumstance<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: difficult circumstances \/ unforeseen circumstances \/ extenuating circumstances \/ given the circumstances<\/span><\/p><p>similar: situation \/ condition \/ factor \/ state of affairs<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: certainty \/ freedom \/ simplicity<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"circumstance","study_direction":"fron