iendly \/ harmless \/ approachable<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"fearsome","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":2,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"3 nap","good":"4 nap","easy":"5 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-18T12:11:19+00:00"},{"id":51280,"front":"<p>She asked a friend to _______ her to the party. <em>(k\u00eds\u00e9r \/ elmegy vele)<\/em><\/p><p>The diplomat was provided with an armed _______ for his protection. <em>(test\u0151r \/ biztos\u00edt\u00e1s)<\/em><\/p><p>The study examined the role of a mentor as an _______ for junior researchers. <em>(ir\u00e1ny\u00edt\u00f3 \/ seg\u00edt\u0151)<\/em><\/p><p>As the ship sailed into the harbor, a smaller tugboat came to _______ it safely to the dock. <em>(vezetni \/ seg\u00edteni a man\u0151verez\u00e9sben)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">k\u00eds\u00e9r \/ v\u00e9d \/ k\u00eds\u00e9ret \/ seg\u00edt \/ vezet<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): elhagy \/ mag\u00e1ra hagy \/ nem seg\u00edt<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ someone to a place = valakit elvinni\/elvezetni egy helyre (pl. He will escort you to your seat.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 provide an _______ = biztos\u00edtani valakit\/valamit (pl. The VIP was provided with an escort.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ service = k\u00eds\u00e9r\u0151 szolg\u00e1ltat\u00e1s (pl. The hotel offers a complimentary escort service.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ a ship = haj\u00f3t k\u00eds\u00e9rni\/vezetni (pl. The pilot will escort the ship into port.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>escort<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>escort<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>escort<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: bodyguard escort \/ security escort \/ military escort \/ police escort<\/span><\/p><p>similar: accompany \/ guide \/ shepherd \/ convoy<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: abandon \/ leave \/ forsake<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"escort","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":2,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"3 nap","good":"4 nap","easy":"5 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-14T18:42:13+00:00"},{"id":51284,"front":"<p>The toddler managed to _______ the delicate toy, leaving only broken pieces. <em>(sz\u00e9tt\u00e9p \/ \u00f6sszet\u00f6r \/ t\u00f6nkretesz)<\/em><\/p><p>The accident caused such severe damage that the car&#039;s chassis was completely _______. <em>(elferd\u00fcl \/ \u00f6sszenyom\u00f3dik \/ deform\u00e1l\u00f3dik)<\/em><\/p><p>The investigative report detailed how the company&#039;s practices had _______ the livelihoods of local residents. <em>(t\u00f6nkretesz \/ megsemmis\u00edt \/ rombol)<\/em><\/p><p>The old printing press would often _______ the paper, creating smudged and illegible text. <em>(elront \/ roncsol \/ sz\u00e9tcinc\u00e1l)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">t\u00f6nkretesz \/ sz\u00e9tt\u00e9p \/ \u00f6sszet\u00f6r \/ elront \/ roncsol<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): megjav\u00edt \/ helyre\u00e1ll\u00edt \/ \u00e9p\u00edt<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ the evidence = bizony\u00edt\u00e9kokat elt\u00fcntet\/megsemmis\u00edt (pl. null)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ someone&#039;s reputation = valaki h\u00edrnev\u00e9t t\u00f6nkreteszi (pl. null)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ a machine = egy g\u00e9pet t\u00f6nkretesz\/roncsol (pl. null)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ the fabric = az anyagot sz\u00e9tt\u00e9pi\/roncsolja (pl. null)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>mangle<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>mangler<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>mangle<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: mangle evidence \/ mangle reputation \/ mangle a document \/ mangle a machine<\/span><\/p><p>similar: destroy \/ ruin \/ smash<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: repair \/ fix \/ restore<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"mangle\nmangler","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":2,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"3 nap","good":"4 nap","easy":"5 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-20T12:11:53+00:00"},{"id":51282,"front":"<p>He decided to _______ down and rest for a while. <em>(pihen \/ nyugszik)<\/em><\/p><p>The company was accused of deliberately _______ the truth about its financial situation. <em>(elhallgat \/ elferd\u00edt)<\/em><\/p><p>The report aims to _______ the current state of research in the field. <em>(ismertet \/ bemutat)<\/em><\/p><p>The old storyteller would often _______ tales of brave knights and mythical beasts. <em>(mes\u00e9l \/ mond)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">fekszik \/ hazudik \/ ter\u00fcl \/ mond \/ besz\u00e9l<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): igazat mond \/ felfed \/ leplez<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ down = lefekszik, lepihen (pl. I&#039;m going to _______ down for a nap.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ the truth = igazat mond (pl. You must always _______ the truth.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ a story = mes\u00e9t mond (pl. She likes to _______ her children a story before bed.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ on its side = az oldal\u00e1n fekszik (pl. The fallen tree _______ on its side.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>lie<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>lie<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: lie down \/ tell a lie \/ lie in bed \/ lie still<\/span><\/p><p>similar: recline \/ rest \/ be situated \/ tell an untruth<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: stand \/ sit \/ tell the truth<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"lie","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":2,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"3 nap","good":"4 nap","easy":"5 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-15T18:54:38+00:00"},{"id":51275,"front":"<p>After a long day, I couldn&#039;t help but _______. <em>(\u00e1s\u00edt \/ t\u00e1togat)<\/em><\/p><p>The speaker&#039;s monotonous delivery caused many in the audience to _______. <em>(\u00e1s\u00edtani \/ el\u00e1lmosodni)<\/em><\/p><p>During the physiological study, participants were instructed to _______ on cue to measure lung capacity. <em>(\u00e1s\u00edtani \/ m\u00e9lyen l\u00e9legezni)<\/em><\/p><p>The weary traveler, huddled by the dying embers, let out a deep, resonant _______. <em>(\u00e1s\u00edt\u00e1s \/ hangos s\u00f3haj)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">\u00e1s\u00edt \/ \u00e1s\u00edt\u00e1s \/ t\u00e1togat \/ el\u00e1lmosodik \/ szomjas<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): fel\u00e9bred \/ \u00e9l\u00e9nk \/ figyel<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ with _______ = \u00e1s\u00edtani valamit\u0151l (pl. He yawned with boredom.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ involuntarily = akaratlanul \u00e1s\u00edtani<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 a deep _______ = m\u00e9ly \u00e1s\u00edt\u00e1s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ from _______ = \u00e1s\u00edtani valamit\u0151l (pl. She yawned from tiredness.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>yawn<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>yawn<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>yawn<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: tired yawn \/ bored yawn \/ deep yawn \/ involuntary yawn<\/span><\/p><p>similar: gape \/ sigh \/ pant \/ breathe deeply<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: wake up \/ be alert \/ stay awake<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"yawn","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":2,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"3 nap","good":"4 nap","easy":"5 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-20T12:10:40+00:00"},{"id":51285,"front":"<p>She had to _______ up the courage to ask for a raise. <em>(\u00f6sszeszed \/ er\u0151t vesz mag\u00e1n)<\/em><\/p><p>The musician began to _______ the strings of his guitar, producing a gentle melody. <em>(penget \/ megr\u00e1nt)<\/em><\/p><p>Farmers often _______ weeds from their fields to ensure a healthy crop. <em>(gyoml\u00e1l \/ kih\u00faz)<\/em><\/p><p>With a sudden _______, he pulled the thorn from his finger. <em>(r\u00e1nt\u00e1s \/ h\u00faz\u00e1s)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 197, 94);\">t\u00e9p \/ leszak\u00edt \/ penget \/ b\u00e1tors\u00e1g<\/span><\/p><p><span>Negative meaning (HU): gy\u00e1vas\u00e1g \/ f\u00e9lelem \/ megfutamod\u00e1s<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ up the courage = \u00f6sszeszedi a b\u00e1tors\u00e1g\u00e1t (pl. He had to _______ up the courage to speak in public.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ a string = megpenget egy h\u00fart (pl. She gently _______ed a string on her harp.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ a feather = kit\u00e9p egy tollat (pl. The bird began to _______ a feather from its wing.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ a flower = leszak\u00edt egy vir\u00e1got (pl. He went to the garden to _______ a flower for his mother.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>pluck<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>pluck<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>pluck<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: pluck up \/ pluck a string \/ pluck a feather \/ pluck a flower<\/span><\/p><p>similar: pull \/ pick \/ courage \/ bravery<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: cowardice \/ fear \/ timidity<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":2,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"3 nap","good":"4 nap","easy":"5 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-18T12:15:48+00:00"},{"id":51268,"front":"<p>He&#039;s so _______, he never changes his mind even when he&#039;s wrong. <em>(makacs \/ merev)<\/em><\/p><p>Despite the overwhelming evidence, the committee remained _______ in its decision. <em>(hajthatatlan \/ kitart\u00f3)<\/em><\/p><p>The research highlights the _______ nature of certain societal attitudes, resisting reform. <em>(kem\u00e9ny \/ rugalmatlan)<\/em><\/p><p>Her _______ refusal to compromise threatened to derail the entire negotiation. <em>(szil\u00e1rd \/ engedetlen)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">makacs \/ kem\u00e9ny \/ merev \/ hajthatatlan \/ szil\u00e1rd<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): enged\u00e9keny \/ rugalmas \/ nyitott<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ child = makacs gyerek (pl. My _______ child refuses to eat vegetables.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ to = valamihez ragaszkod\u00f3 (pl. He&#039;s _______ to his old ways.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ refusal = makacs visszautas\u00edt\u00e1s (pl. Her _______ refusal to cooperate was frustrating.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ attitude = makacs hozz\u00e1\u00e1ll\u00e1s (pl. The _______ attitude of the management made progress difficult.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>stubborn<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>stubborn<\/strong><\/p><p>adverb: <strong>stubbornly<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>stubbornness<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: stubborn mule \/ stubborn fact \/ stubborn stain \/ stubborn resistance<\/span><\/p><p>similar: obstinate \/ unyielding \/ inflexible \/ headstrong<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: flexible \/ compliant \/ amenable<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"2 perc","good":"10 perc","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-14T06:54:21+00:00"},{"id":51271,"front":"<p>_______ of the slippery steps, especially when it&#039;s raining. <em>(vigy\u00e1zz \/ l\u00e9gy \u00f3vatos)<\/em><\/p><p>The company issued a statement urging investors to _______ of potential market volatility. <em>(\u00f3vakodjon \/ figyeljen oda)<\/em><\/p><p>Researchers advise the public to _______ of consuming raw seafood due to the risk of contamination. <em>(tart\u00f3zkodjon \/ ker\u00fclje el)<\/em><\/p><p>In ancient tales, travelers were often warned to _______ of the enchanted forest, for few who entered ever returned. <em>(\u00f3vakodj \/ vigy\u00e1zz)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">vigy\u00e1zz \/ \u00f3vakodik \/ l\u00e9gy \u00f3vatos \/ figyelj \/ tartsd magad t\u00e1vol<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): b\u00edzz \/ ne f\u00e9lj \/ menj bele<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ of = vigy\u00e1zz valamire\/valakit\u0151l (pl. _______ of the dog.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ of the consequences = gondolj a k\u00f6vetkezm\u00e9nyekre, l\u00e9gy \u00f3vatos a k\u00f6vetkezm\u00e9nyekkel (pl. _______ of the consequences before you act.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ of the dangers = vigy\u00e1zz a vesz\u00e9lyekre (pl. _______ of the dangers of the sea.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ of what you say = vigy\u00e1zz, mit mondasz (pl. _______ of what you say in front of the children.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>beware<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: beware of \/ beware the \/ beware of the \/ beware of dogs<\/span><\/p><p>similar: be careful \/ watch out \/ take care \/ mind<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: trust \/ approach \/ welcome<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"beware","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":2,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"3 nap","good":"4 nap","easy":"5 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-18T12:10:35+00:00"}]},"url":"\/flashcards\/38\/study","version":"e2b22e37706595fec52e55935d2eb5d9","sharedProps":["errors","name","auth","sidebarOpen","flash"]}</script><div id="app"></div><?php /**PATH /var/www/clients/client982/web3567/web/topwords.eu/storage/framework/views/bc3c27bcc3c01dabe2505d2ee401f52b.blade.php ENDPATH**/ ?>